# Supabase (LeadOrbit)

- Target project is **LeadOrbit** (`kqmuxocbmtydkxdvmypy`). Never modify the separate **linkbook** project or its database.
- When shipping SQL under `supabase/migrations/`, also apply it to the live LeadOrbit project (MCP `apply_migration` / `execute_sql`) in the same session — do not leave migrations repo-only.
- Prefer the exact migration file contents; do not invent a simplified substitute when applying.
- After apply, verify with `list_migrations` and a targeted `execute_sql` check (tables/RPCs/indexes).
- Commit and push schema + app changes to `main` after verification.
